- Cash balance (current) and projected balance by month (3–12 months)
- Net cash burn (monthly) and 3-month trailing average
- Runway (months) under 3 scenarios (base / planned investments / downside)
- Revenue run rate and month-over-month growth
- Gross margin and contribution margin
- Accounts receivable days (DSO) and cash conversion lag
- One-time/committed outflows (capex, debt service, tax, vendor prepayments)

