- Consider short-term levers to extend runway: tighten discretionary hiring, delay non-critical capex, accelerate AR collections, negotiate vendor terms, and examine sale-leaseback or non-dilutive financing.
- If fundraising is anticipated, present 12–18 months of monthly cash forecasts and use the conservative runway (20 months or downside case) to set timing.

