- “Our cash balance is $5.2M, and at our reported net burn of $195K we have more than two years of runway — however we are running sensitivity analyses because planned investments and seasonality could shorten runway; we’ll define clear trigger points for cost actions and fundraising to preserve strategic optionality.”
