- “Request approval to: (1) implement a hiring freeze for non-critical roles, (2) defer non-essential capital projects, and (3) approve a 12-month cash flow model and weekly cash reporting cadence. We will return with scenario analysis and recommended financing options if runway metrics fall below 18 months under the base case.”

8) Next steps I can do for you
