- If burn is increasing: "Net burn has increased to ~$260K/month, largely due to one-time ramp investments (hiring, temporary capacity) and timing of receivables. We expect burn to normalize to ~$195K/month after [milestone]. If revenue acceleration does not materialize, we will implement contingency cost mitigations."

